---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';



const articleLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "BirkyStudio vs Sierra Interactive (2026 Comparison), a Rented IDX Lead Machine vs a Front Desk You Own",
  "description": "Honest head-to-head comparison of BirkyStudio vs Sierra Interactive for real estate agents. Sierra Interactive is an SEO-built IDX website, CRM and lead generation platform from $299.95 per month on a 12-month agreement. BirkyStudio is a done-for-you AI operator that answers your phone and WhatsApp 24/7, follows up automatically, and hands you verified prospects you own. Real pricing, real reviews, no bias.",
  "author": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Luna Jerney",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com"
  },
  "publisher": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Birky Studio",
    "url": "https://birkystudio.com",
    "logo": {
      "@type": "ImageObject",
      "url": "https://birkystudio.com/images/birky-logo.jpg"
    }
  },
  "datePublished": "2026-10-20",
  "dateModified": "2026-10-20"
});

const faqLD = JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Sierra Interactive more expensive than BirkyStudio?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Sierra Interactive is priced per month on a 12-month agreement, and the amount depends on how you pay. Prepay the year and Starter is $299.95 per month for one user, Essential is $399.95 per month for three users, and Growth is $599.95 per month for five users, with no setup fee. Split the same 12-month agreement into monthly payments and it costs $359.95, $474.95, and $724.95 per month plus a one-time $500 setup fee. Adding Lead Engage, Sierra's AI lead nurture add-on, is another $199 per month and is not available on Starter. BirkyStudio is a one-time build: The Base Agent is $1,297 solo (Notion CRM included), the Text Receptionist is $297, and the Voice Receptionist is $550 plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month. Higher upfront, no per-seat fee, nothing to renew."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Sierra Interactive answer my phone or reply on WhatsApp?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Sierra Interactive is a real estate IDX website, CRM, and lead generation platform, not an AI answering service, and its Lead Engage add-on is AI texting rather than a voice agent. It does not pick up an inbound phone call and it does not answer WhatsApp. BirkyStudio's Voice Receptionist is $550 one-time (plus Vapi usage of about $30 to $50 a month) and answers calls 24/7 in English and Spanish. The WhatsApp Text Receptionist is $297 one-time and holds full AI conversations."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does Sierra Interactive cost per year?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Prepaid annually, Sierra Interactive Starter is $299.95 per month, so about $3,599 per year for one user. Essential is about $4,799 per year for three users and Growth is about $7,199 per year for five users. Paying monthly under the same 12-month agreement adds a $500 setup fee and raises the rates to about $4,319, $5,699, and $8,699 per year. Extra users cost $75 per month on Starter, $60 per month for users 4 to 10 on Essential, and $20 per month for users 6 to 10 on Growth. Lead Engage is $199 per month on Essential and Growth, which brings a small team to about $7,187 per year before any ad spend. Prices verified on sierrainteractive.com/pricing in October 2026."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Sierra Interactive include a website, and do I own it?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A website is included in the Sierra Interactive subscription, and it is genuinely one of the best ranking IDX websites in the category. What is not included is ownership. The site, its pages, and its search experience live on Sierra's infrastructure, and an industry analysis of all-in-one platforms puts the norm plainly: when you cancel, the site goes dark or gets recycled and you do not walk away with the files, the code, or the hosting. Third party roundups make the SEO point bluntly, that domain authority built on a rented URL restarts at zero. BirkyStudio builds a website you own for $499 for a 1 to 3 page Starter site, $999 for a Professional 4 to 7 page bilingual site, or $1,999 for a Premium 10+ page site with a blog. The code is yours and nobody can hold your site or your domain to ransom."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Sierra Interactive have a free trial?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. Sierra Interactive is demo only. There is no published free trial and no self serve signup, you have to schedule a demo and talk to sales. Pricing is published, which is better than most rivals in this category, but there is no way to test the platform first. BirkyStudio offers a free 15-minute audit up front and a 30-day money-back guarantee on the build."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does Sierra Interactive find me leads?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Sierra Interactive does not sell you a list. Its lead engine is organic search from an SEO-built IDX website plus paid advertising you fund and run. Google ad management costs a 10 percent monthly management fee on top of a minimum $500 monthly ad spend, which is $6,000 a year in ad spend alone, and Facebook management is $75 per month on the Lite pack or $200 per month on the Full pack. BirkyStudio hands you a verified, enriched, scored prospect list for your niche and area ($497 Starter, $997 Pro, one-time), and the $1,997 Lead Generation Pack adds outreach plus the AI that catches the replies around the clock. You own the list, so there is nothing to cancel."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What happens to my website and SEO if I cancel Sierra Interactive?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Your contacts can usually be exported as a CSV, though reviewers report that notes, tags, and behavioral history do not come with them cleanly. The bigger loss is the website. Every neighbourhood page, blog post, and landing page you built on a Sierra site lives at a URL Sierra controls. Cancel and the pages go dark, the links pointing at them break, and any SEO traction those specific URLs had accumulated has to be rebuilt from scratch at new addresses. BirkyStudio builds the site on your own account, so the pages stay exactly where they are if you ever stop working with us."
      }
    }
  ]
});
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BirkyStudio vs Sierra Interactive (2026)"
  description="Honest 2026 comparison: Sierra Interactive is an SEO-built IDX website, CRM and lead engine from $299.95/month on a 12-month agreement. BirkyStudio answers your phone and hands you a website you own."
  image="/images/comparison/sierra.jpg"
  >
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={articleLD} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={faqLD} />

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section style="padding:100px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
      <div style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 20px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:100px;color:white;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Updated October 2026 • Honest comparison
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.15;">
        BirkyStudio vs Sierra Interactive<br>
        <span style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-accent),var(--bs-accent));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">A Rented IDX Lead Machine vs a Front Desk You Own</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;max-width:700px;">
        Sierra Interactive builds one of the genuinely best ranking IDX websites in real estate, with published pricing starting at $299.95 a month on a 12-month agreement, an MLS feed included, a dialer on the upper plans, and an AI texting add-on called Lead Engage. What it does not give you is the website itself: cancel and the site, its pages, and the SEO equity you built on those URLs stay behind. BirkyStudio is a one-time build. We answer your phone and WhatsApp 24/7 in English and Spanish, follow up automatically, and hand you verified prospects plus a website whose code you own. Here is the honest breakdown, including the parts where Sierra Interactive wins.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section style="padding:80px 0">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;">

      <!-- Quick Answer -->
      <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-bg-raised),var(--bs-bg-raised));border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:64px;border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);">
        <h2 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">⚡ Quick Answer</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose BirkyStudio if:</strong> You want the phone answered and the follow-up handled without you, and you would rather own your website, your pages and your prospect list than rent them. You get an AI agent that replies in seconds in two languages, an AI receptionist on WhatsApp and voice, verified, enriched, scored prospects you keep forever, and a site built on your own account that stays live even if you stop working with us.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">Choose Sierra Interactive if:</strong> Organic search is the core of your lead strategy, you have the lead volume to justify $300 to $600 a month indefinitely, and you want a niche real estate CRM with an IDX website that genuinely ranks, lead routing for a team, and a dialer included on the upper plans. Its SEO-built websites are the reason teams talk about it, and we are not going to pretend otherwise.<br><br>
          <strong style="color:white;">The honest difference:</strong> Sierra Interactive is a platform you rent, and the website only exists while the subscription does. It does not answer your phone, it does not hold a WhatsApp conversation, and its AI follow-up is a $199 a month add-on you cannot even buy on the entry plan. BirkyStudio is an operator we build for you, priced once, doing the answering and the following up, on a website you own outright.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 1 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/sierra-article-1.jpg" alt="Real estate agent workspace with a laptop showing a property search and printed neighbourhood brochures on a desk" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Why Compare -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:16px;">Why compare BirkyStudio and Sierra Interactive?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        These two get compared because both promise the same outcome, more qualified conversations with fewer hours of admin, and because they sit at opposite ends of one question: do you rent the machine or own it? Sierra Interactive has been in the market since 2007 and sells an all-in-one platform built around what it calls SEO-driven IDX websites. Every plan includes one MLS feed, IDX property search with saved searches and alerts, a real estate CRM with behavioral automation, lead capture across the site, and email support with 30 to 90 days of onboarding. Essential and Growth add a built-in dialer with monthly SMS, MMS and voice allotments. Growth adds premium website designs and team reporting. Lead Engage, its AI texting for lead nurture, is $199 a month on Essential and Growth.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
        BirkyStudio takes the other route. Instead of renting you a platform to operate, we build an AI operator that does the front desk work for you. The Base Agent reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it to a Notion CRM built for agents, answers it instantly, and follows up automatically in English and Spanish. Add the AI Receptionist and the phone is answered around the clock. Add a Verified Prospect List and you start with real, enriched, scored prospects you own, no bots and no dead numbers.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:40px;">
        The real difference is not features, it is ownership and who does the work. Sierra rents you an excellent website and a CRM on a 12-month agreement that costs roughly $3,599 to $7,199 a year before add-ons. BirkyStudio delivers a one-time build that answers your leads and that you keep. That is what this page breaks down, honestly, including where Sierra Interactive is the better buy.
      </p>

      <!-- Comparison Table -->
      <h2 id="comparison" style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">BirkyStudio vs Sierra Interactive, Side by Side</h2>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.9rem;">
          <thead>
            <tr style="border-bottom:2px solid var(--bs-accent);">
