            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">AI Conversations on WhatsApp / Text</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Text Receptionist $297 one-time, full AI conversations</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">⚠️</span> Lead Engage $199/mo, Essential and Growth only</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Website Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ $499 / $999 / $1,999 one-time, you own the code</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included in the subscription, genuinely strong SEO build</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Website Ownership</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Your code, your hosting, your pages stay live</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Vendor owned, cancel and the site goes dark</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">MLS / IDX Integration</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Not an MLS-based platform</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ 1 MLS feed included, $25/mo per extra feed, IDX search</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Organic Search Lead Engine</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">⚠️</span> Bilingual SEO blog, not a niche IDX ranking engine</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Its strongest card, schema-built local pages designed to rank</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Where Your Leads Come From</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Verified, enriched, scored prospect list you own forever</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">⚠️</span> Organic search plus paid ads you fund and run</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
