              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;"><span class="mark-soft">✕</span> Not offered as a managed service</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Google PPC 10% of spend ($500/mo minimum spend), Facebook $75 or $200/mo</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Dialer and Text Messaging</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ AI voice and WhatsApp receptionist, 24/7, EN/ES</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included on Essential and Growth, $100/mo on Starter</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Per-User Cost</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ No per-seat fee, scaled once in the business tier</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">$75/user/mo (Starter), $60 (Essential 4-10), $20 (Growth 6-10)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Bilingual (EN/ES)</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✕ English-focused</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">CRM Included</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Notion CRM built for agents, free with the Base Agent</td>
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">✅ Full real estate CRM, behavioral automation included</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
              <td style="padding:14px 12px;color:white;font-weight:600;">Who Does the Work</td>
