            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <!-- Article Image 2 -->
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:64px;">
        <img src="/images/comparison/sierra-article-2.jpg" alt="Laptop on an oak desk showing a website traffic chart trending upward beside a leather notebook" style="width:100%;max-width:800px;border-radius:12px;height:auto;box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);" loading="lazy">
      </div>

      <!-- Detailed Review: BirkyStudio -->
      <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:white;margin-bottom:32px;">Detailed Reviews</h2>

      <div id="birky-studio" style="background:rgba(255,45,149,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <span style="background:var(--bs-accent);color:white;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:100px;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;">IT WORKS FOR YOU</span>
          <h3 style="color:white;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0;">BirkyStudio</h3>
        </div>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          BirkyStudio is not a platform you log into and work. It is an operator that runs in the background. The Base Agent ($1,297 solo, from $2,997 for a team) reads every website and WhatsApp enquiry, sorts it, saves it to a Notion CRM built for agents, answers it instantly, and follows up automatically, in English and Spanish. The CRM is included free, so you are not paying a subscription for a database.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Add the AI Receptionist and the front desk is covered around the clock. The Text Receptionist for WhatsApp is $297 one-time and holds real AI conversations. The Voice Receptionist is $550 one-time, plus you pay Vapi directly for usage (about $30 to $50 a month), and it answers calls 24/7 in both languages. Add a Verified Prospect List ($497 Starter, $997 Pro, one-time) and you start with real, enriched, scored prospects you own forever, no bots and no dead numbers. The $1,997 Lead Generation Pack ties it together: the list, automated outreach, an AI agent trained on your pitch, and the receptionist that catches every reply.
